Scope of this notice

The MIT license above covers the code of this project's emulator core that
is derived from nullDC4Wii and the code written for this project.

It does NOT cover files derived from other projects, which keep their own
licenses:

  - plugs/vbaARM/ (ARM7 interpreter adapted from VisualBoyAdvance):
