    version.
  - ../src/core/naomi_des.* (DES tables and algorithm after MAME's
    naomigd.cpp): BSD-3-Clause, Copyright Olivier Galibert.
  - ../third_party/ (libchdr, LZMA SDK, zlib, zstd, dr_flac): see the
    license files in each folder.

Because the program as built and distributed includes GPL-licensed code,
the combined binary is distributed under the GNU General Public License,
